[0.001, "o", "\u001b[38;2;167;139;250m◆\u001b[39m  \u001b[1m\u001b[38;2;167;139;250mVendo Cloud\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  \u001b[38;2;167;139;250m✦\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;167;139;250ma free starter model allowance — no card, no model key of your own\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  \u001b[38;2;167;139;250m✦\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;167;139;250mhosted automations, team sharing, and the console\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  \u001b[1m\u001b[38;2;167;139;250m→\u001b[39m\u001b[22m Vendo Cloud key (agent path): run \u001b[1m\u001b[38;2;167;139;250mvendo login\u001b[39m\u001b[22m — it prints a code your human approves in the browser, and\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  the minted VENDO_API_KEY lands in .env.local (never printed).\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  Then re-run \u001b[1m\u001b[38;2;167;139;250mvendo init\u001b[39m\u001b[22m (it picks the key up) or pass --cloud-key <key>. Protocol: https://vendo.run/auth.md\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  No Cloud account wanted? Re-run with --byo and set a provider key (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY / OPENAI_API_KEY /\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY).\r\n"]
