[0.003, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[38;2;167;139;250m◆\u001b[39m  \u001b[1mYour brand, captured\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  \u001b[48;2;31;111;235m  \u001b[49m #1f6feb accent   \u001b[48;2;255;255;255m  \u001b[49m #ffffff background   \u001b[48;2;16;19;35m  \u001b[49m #101323 text   \u001b[48;2;209;36;47m  \u001b[49m #d1242f danger\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  Type: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif · radius 10px\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  No host evidence for border, surface, mutedText — neutral defaults used.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  \u001b[2mTheme lives in .vendo/theme.json — edit it anytime; it is the source of truth.\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.313, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  \u001b[1m\u001b[38;2;167;139;250m→\u001b[39m\u001b[22m No model key yet: set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY / OPENAI_API_KEY / GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY in .env.local, or\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  run \u001b[1m\u001b[38;2;167;139;250mvendo login\u001b[39m\u001b[22m for a free dev key.\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[38;2;167;139;250m◇\u001b[39m  \u001b[1mOne paste left — app/layout.tsx\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    import { VendoProvider } from \"@vendoai/vendo/react\";\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    import theme from \"../.vendo/theme.json\";\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    import type { VendoTheme } from \"@vendoai/vendo\";\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    <VendoProvider baseUrl=\"/api/vendo\" theme={theme as VendoTheme}>\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m      \u001b[2m…\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    </VendoProvider>\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    \u001b[2mdocs.vendo.run/quickstart#the-client-mount — exact wording for layout.tsx and _app.tsx\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  <VendoProvider> is what the @vendoai/ui hooks and embeds read; baseUrl is the wire mount, path prefix\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  included. Until this lands, Vendo is wired but nothing on the page can reach it.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  \u001b[2minit never edits your files\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  Verify everything: \u001b[1m\u001b[38;2;167;139;250mnpx vendo doctor\u001b[39m\u001b[22m (it can start the server and run a live turn).\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  Agent tail:\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    auth: none wired — sessions stay anonymous until a preset is added\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    edit app/api/vendo/[...vendo]/route.ts — add the auth preset named in the advisory above when the host\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  has auth\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    edit app/layout.tsx — wrap the app in the <VendoProvider> lines above (without it, nothing on the page\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  can reach Vendo)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    edit .vendo/brief.md — replace the placeholder with what this product does and for whom\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    \u001b[1m\u001b[38;2;167;139;250m→\u001b[39m\u001b[22m cloud key: none — for Vendo Cloud, fetch https://vendo.run/auth.md and run \u001b[1m\u001b[38;2;167;139;250mvendo login\u001b[39m\u001b[22m (your human\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  approves a code in the browser; the key lands in .env.local), then re-run init or pass --cloud-key <key>;\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m  --byo with a provider key also works\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m    gate: run \u001b[1m\u001b[38;2;167;139;250mvendo doctor --json\u001b[39m\u001b[22m — done when every check reports green\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[2m└\u001b[22m  \u001b[32mDone in 273.5s\u001b[39m \u001b[2m— 2 tools · brand captured · 1 paste left\u001b[22m\r\n"]
